{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/extras/Hack.png?t=1749252320\" />Fight, hack, and survive in a world overrun by hostile machines, where each incursion is a race against death. Lia: Hacking Destiny is a fast-paced action roguelite with intense combat and choices that shape your journey toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/extras/ataque_teste4.gif?t=1749252320\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge attacks, slide along walls, and combine weapons and abilities to crush enemies in adrenaline-filled battles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is unique. Security complexes change every time, with procedurally generated rooms, traps, and enemies. Learn, adapt, and push further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Constant Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapons, unlock abilities, modify equipment, and personalize your playstyle. From aggressive builds to tactical strategies. The power is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hack the System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use technology to your advantage. Modify alert levels to access secret rooms and uncover hidden secrets behind walls of concrete and steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/extras/Key_en.png?t=1749252320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/extras/boss_teste4.gif?t=1749252320\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fluid combat with responsive controls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelite systems with ever-changing maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable skills and weapons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base with NPCs and permanent upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant visual style with a post-apocalyptic atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/extras/baixo_teste3.png?t=1749252320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/extras/npcs_teste2.gif?t=1749252320\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect from this demo:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    </strong>\u2022    Explore 2 unique biomes full of challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    \u2022    Try out the combat mechanics, weapons, and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    \u2022    Face an epic boss at the end of your run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f This is just a taste of what\u2019s coming. The full content will be available soon! </strong> <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780400?t=1749252320","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780400?t=1749252320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/cdff69b158f005ad0b31577b8953dd81a60a242f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749252320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780400/cdff69b158f005ad0b31577b8953dd81a60a242f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749252320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller 